# Pearl Agent — project rules

## Stack (do not change without explicit user request)

- **Construction**: Shopify storefront + minimal H5 embed
- **UI**: HTML + **Tailwind CSS** (high whitespace, modern sans, minimal lines)
- **Canvas**: **HTML5 Canvas** for bracelet rendering / gestures
- **Logic**: **Vanilla JS** (ES modules) — no React/Vue/Svelte for MVP
- **Commerce**: Shopify (Storefront later); MVP catalog from Excel → `catalog.json`

## MVP scope (phase 1+)

**In scope — Home shell + DIY + Design Details:**

1. Home — banner, service icons (placeholders), DIY dual CTAs, Design Plaza preview (6), bottom tabs
2. Tab stubs — Design Plaza, My Designs, Me
3. Top bar — wrist circumference, price, help modal
4. Center canvas — circular track, add / reorder / drag-out delete
5. Middle bar — clear, recommend stub, Make Now → Design Details
6. Bottom shelf — Beads/Accessories + category sidebar + product cards
7. Design Details — snapshot, rename, BOM, notes; Continue / checkout stub

**Out of scope until asked:** Shopify checkout, cloud save, paid recommend, Shopify live API, live share/submit, phone-charm designer.

## Directory map

```text
index.html                      # Studio shell + #app mount point
src/main.js                     # Boot + wire Home ↔ DIY ↔ Details
src/pages/home/                 # Home page + plaza mock data
src/pages/plaza|myDesigns|me/   # Tab stub pages
src/pages/diy/                  # DIY page (page.html, canvas/, ui/)
src/pages/details/              # Design Details (page.html, bom.js)
src/shared/                     # state, domain, data, nav, studio UI, tabBar
src/styles/main.css
data/commodity_idx.xlsx         # canonical SKU workbook
new_input/                      # drop zone → npm run sync:catalog
public/brand|icons|products
docs/ .cursor/rules/
```

## Coding norms

- Keep page code under `src/pages/{home,plaza,myDesigns,me,diy,details}/` — do not mix page markup/logic
- Shared catalog/state/pricing/nav lives in `src/shared/` only
- Prefer small ES modules; keep Canvas logic out of DOM shelf code
- State flows one way: shelf click → store → canvas + top bar subscribe
- Nav: Home tabs ↔ DIY (back → Home) ↔ Design Details; tab bar hidden in studio pages
- Page chrome: every page uses `.page-header`; never `absolute; inset:0` on page roots (breaks safe-area) — see `.cursor/rules/page-chrome.mdc`
- **Shopify sync:** every store-facing change must be committed + pushed so GitHub Pages (Shopify iframe) updates — see `.cursor/rules/shopify-sync.mdc`
- English UI copy for overseas market; keep labels concise
- New SKUs: put batch xlsx + png in `new_input/` → `npm run sync:catalog` (merges into `data/commodity_idx.xlsx`)
- UI logo/icons stay in `public/brand` and `public/icons` — never in `new_input/`
- Do not add frameworks, CSS-in-JS, or heavy canvas libraries unless requested
